## nocved: record every execve so short-lived processes reach audit.log
## (DESIGN.md section 11). Installed to /etc/audit/rules.d/50-nocved.rules by
## install.sh and the Ansible playbook, then loaded with `augenrules --load`.
## Without it the auditd source reports coverage `partial` ("no EXECVE record").
## The key only tags records; nocved does not filter on it.
-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -S execve -k nocved_exec
-a always,exit -F arch=b32 -S execve -k nocved_exec
